Qwen4-Exp 2-bit MoE support for SGLang
======================================

Adds a 2-bit path to moe_wna16 plus the fixes needed to serve
Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on a single 24 GB sm_120 GPU with CPU offload.

Contents:
  - 2-bit unpacking in fused_moe_kernel_gptq_awq
  - MoE-aware expert streaming (new file: layers/moe/expert_stream.py)
  - mmap-backed PLE n-gram embedding for hosts that cannot pin 51 GB
  - offloader fixes: tie_weights, stale param.data views, expert-only offload
  - qwen_sparse_attention in the decoder layer allowlist
  - packed_modules_mapping for Qwen4-Exp

Applies to SGLang. Licensed under Apache-2.0, same as SGLang itself.
See WRITEUP.md for what each change does and why.

  git apply sglang-qwen4exp-2bit.patch

